        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027751-d4719356fff44c8a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027751",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing our lead product candidate, buntanetap, which is designed to address AD, PD, and potentially other chronic neurodegenerative diseases.",
        "start_character": 12990,
        "end_character": 13142
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027751",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027751-d4719356fff44c8a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027751",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We therefore rely and expect to continue to rely solely on third-party contractors for manufacturing clinical supplies for our current and future potential product candidates, and plan to do so for commercial supplies also, if any of our product candidates receive marketing approval.",
        "start_character": 80743,
        "end_character": 81027
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027751",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027751-d4719356fff44c8a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027751",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●If we are not successful in discovering, developing, and commercializing additional product candidates, our ability to expand our business and achieve our strategic objectives may be impaired.",
        "start_character": 7648,
        "end_character": 7841
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027751",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027751-d4719356fff44c8a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027751",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●If we are unable to obtain, maintain and enforce patent or other intellectual property protection for buntanetap or any future product candidates or technology, or if the scope of the patent protection obtained is not sufficiently broad, our competitors or other third parties could develop and commercialize products similar or identical to ours, our ability to successfully commercialize buntanetap or any future product candidates may be adversely affected and we may not be able to compete effectively in our markets.",
        "start_character": 11047,
        "end_character": 11569
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027751",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027751-d4719356fff44c8a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027751",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●The successful commercialization of buntanetap and any other product candidates we develop will depend in part on market acceptance;",
        "start_character": 9771,
        "end_character": 9904
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027751",
