        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●We will require substantial additional capital to fund our operations, and if we fail to obtain necessary funding, we may not be able to complete the development and commercialization of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 6537,
        "end_character": 6748
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027751",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027751-d4719356fff44c8a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027751",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●our ability to obtain and maintain regulatory approval of our existing product candidates and any other product candidates we may develop, and the labeling under any approval we may obtain;",
        "start_character": 2960,
